<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Get started on Facebook</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #1c1e21;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 450px;
        }

        .back-arrow {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .meta-logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #0064e0;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #65676b;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .info-icon {
            display: inline-flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 1px solid #65676b;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #65676b;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .row-2 {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .row-3 {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        input[type="text"],
        input[type="password"],
        select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #ccd0d5;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
            background-color: #fff;
        }

        input::placeholder {
            color: #8d949e;
        }

        input:focus, select:focus {
            border-color: #0064e0;
        }

        select {
            appearance: none;
            background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;charset=UTF-8,%3csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='%3c65676b' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'%3e%3cpolyline points='6 9 12 15 18 9'%3e%3c/polyline%3e%3c/svg%3e");
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-position: right 12px center;
            background-size: 16px;
            padding-right: 32px;
        }

        .disclaimer {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #65676b;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .disclaimer a {
            color: #0064e0;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .btn-submit {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            background-color: #0064e0;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .btn-submit:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            background-color: #e4e6eb;
            color: #050505;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background-color: #d8dadf;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="back-arrow">&lt;</div>
    
    <div class="meta-logo">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#0064e0">
            <path d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.477 2 12c0 4.991 3.657 9.128 8.438 9.879V14.89h-2.54V12h2.54V9.797c0-2.506 1.492-3.89 3.777-3.89 1.094 0 2.238.195 2.238.195v2.46h-1.26c-1.243 0-1.63.771-1.63 1.562V12h2.773l-.443 2.89h-2.33v6.989C18.343 21.129 22 16.99 22 12c0-5.523-4.477-10-10-10z"/>
        </svg>
        Meta
    </div>

    <h1>Get started on Facebook with a Meta account</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">A Meta Account lets you access multiple Meta technologies, such as Facebook, easily and securely.</p>

    <form>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Name</label>
            <div class="row-2">
                <input type="text" placeholder="First name" required>
                <input type="text" placeholder="Surname" required>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Date of birth <span class="info-icon">?</span></label>
            <div class="row-3">
                <select required>
                    <option value="" disabled selected>Day</option>
                    <option value="1">1</option>
                    <option value="2">2</option>
                </select>
                <select required>
                    <option value="" disabled selected>Month</option>
                    <option value="Jan">Jan</option>
                    <option value="Feb">Feb</option>
                </select>
                <select required>
                    <option value="" disabled selected>Year</option>
                    <option value="2026">2026</option>
                    <option value="2025">2025</option>
                </select>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Gender <span class="info-icon">?</span></label>
            <select required>
                <option value="" disabled selected>Select your gender</option>
                <option value="female">Female</option>
                <option value="male">Male</option>
                <option value="custom">Custom</option>
            </select>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Mobile number or email address</label>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Mobile number or email address" required>
        </div>

        <p class="disclaimer">
            You may receive notifications from us. <a href="#">Learn why we ask for your contact information</a>
        </p>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Password</label>
            <input type="password" placeholder="Password" required>
        </div>

        <p class="disclaimer">
            People who use our service may have uploaded your contact information to Facebook. <a href="#">Learn more.</a>
        </p>
        
        <p class="disclaimer">
            By tapping Submit, you agree to create an account and to Facebook's <a href="#">Terms</a>, <a href="#">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="#">Cookies Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="disclaimer">
            The <a href="#">Privacy Policy</a> describes the ways we can use the information we collect when you create an account. For example, we use this information to provide, personalise and improve our products, including ads.
        </p>

        <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Submit</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-secondary">I already have an account</button>
    </form>
</div>

</body>
</html>
